      "questionId": "qe-c10-0178",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p119-01335-s003",
      "sentenceText": "We are clearly mistaken to think that not making any changes to our commute and keeping to ourselves would be better than talking to a fellow commuter.",
      "sentenceSha256": "db28c8c5e0a788081f814d184e28d66fd66e9e2649db013c6ca1395c784045dd",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p119-01335-r003-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-103",
      "parentFingerprint": "b699124fc89d322cf7a061eabdb0d2d3243ea5602a3ea3239d071fb257c1b1cc",
      "passageSha256": "8fc48a9eef4dd32943d1ed45a2cc16d5eaa44769c15c1f32a1ccffb42b721e18",
      "pdfPages": [
        119
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0179",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p119-01335-s004",
      "sentenceText": "We think sticking to a routine commute is better than making a new social connection: a clear familiarity bias.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9ed8f3f34a7e6bc8dfe90ba8ef2e1cc35995c84d9226844954c55b7112004fed",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p119-01335-r003-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-103",
      "parentFingerprint": "b699124fc89d322cf7a061eabdb0d2d3243ea5602a3ea3239d071fb257c1b1cc",
      "passageSha256": "8fc48a9eef4dd32943d1ed45a2cc16d5eaa44769c15c1f32a1ccffb42b721e18",
      "pdfPages": [
        119
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0180",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p119-01335-s005",
      "sentenceText": "We settle on a job candidate or potential mate before exploring enough.",
      "sentenceSha256": "165fe437b2dda4b7452af84b3e76d358c3de90294e14e013dfaaf918e94635a2",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p119-01335-r003-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-103",
      "parentFingerprint": "b699124fc89d322cf7a061eabdb0d2d3243ea5602a3ea3239d071fb257c1b1cc",
      "passageSha256": "8fc48a9eef4dd32943d1ed45a2cc16d5eaa44769c15c1f32a1ccffb42b721e18",
      "pdfPages": [
        119
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0181",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s09-p119-04185-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Steve Jobs didn’t suffer from a familiarity bias—he was eager to explore the unknown world of India at age nineteen.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e66e56d83257106959cd52bcda46c91e626dc0fa89f1ddf6d22e102bfc729f2f",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s09-p119-04185-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-104",
      "parentFingerprint": "fd0cba1134b1c5fc2b4b7f909ecfc85b719d778efd256b8d1f2c791e951a12da",
      "passageSha256": "e18a3565f1738f30ce391324022289acd3368ab8068bdbb8cd768f4d8aa9fb6f",
      "pdfPages": [
        119
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0182",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s09-p119-04185-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Unfortunately, he got sick and lost a lot of weight.",
      "sentenceSha256": "65ebe33d2f0e26f14e07b00ded96375390e1d3627ef07f12aba5961525800d72",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s09-p119-04185-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-104",
      "parentFingerprint": "fd0cba1134b1c5fc2b4b7f909ecfc85b719d778efd256b8d1f2c791e951a12da",
      "passageSha256": "e18a3565f1738f30ce391324022289acd3368ab8068bdbb8cd768f4d8aa9fb6f",
      "pdfPages": [
        119
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0183",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s09-p119-04185-s004",
      "sentenceText": "He made a lot of brilliant choices and some questionable ones thanks to his unique decision-making style, which balanced rationality and intuition.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b99ff7543d12c9e4b393261727af3bd655c27abb71c917888705f615e8a8a099",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s09-p119-04185-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-104",
      "parentFingerprint": "fd0cba1134b1c5fc2b4b7f909ecfc85b719d778efd256b8d1f2c791e951a12da",
      "passageSha256": "e18a3565f1738f30ce391324022289acd3368ab8068bdbb8cd768f4d8aa9fb6f",
      "pdfPages": [
        119
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0184",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s09-p119-05355-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Steve Jobs was idiosyncratic, a true one and only.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2885f454606ef34e50470cfc17c6dda81e9193619002da306c2cc41b73d990f9",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s09-p119-05355-r001-004",
